        "id": 98994,
        "name": "Funky_Punk",
        "username": "Funky_Punk",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/funky_punk/{size}/2352_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-26T14:22:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've often believed that the best lineup of heroes is all the complexity 1 heroes. &nbsp;These don't need much set-up to do damage and they can do quite a bit. &nbsp;And because they don't need much set-up they don't have to worry much about the villian destroying their equipment or ongoings. &nbsp;To test this theory I pitted the complexity 1 heroes from the base game against a difficulty 4 villian. &nbsp;I chose to fight The Chairman and I wiped him out. &nbsp;I think what helped the most was 2 Ground Pounds and 1 heroic interception.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:26:49.570Z",
